        "source_solution": "Task: evaluate four products involving fractions, decimals and mixed numbers.\na: (5/9)*(4/7)*(14/3)=280/189=40/27.\nb: 0.6*0.5*12=3.6.\nc: 3 1/16=49/16; 2 14/25=64/25; roots (7/4)*(8/5)=14/5.\nd: 5 1/16=81/16; 2 34/81=196/81; roots (9/4)*(14/9)=7/2.\nDistinction: preserve all factors and mixed-number wholes.",
        "unit_reason": "One coherent quartet compares complete extraction across the three representation types, not a collection of answer boxes.",
        "concept_blocks": [
