      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "Evaluate $\\sqrt{1-10a+25a^2}-4a$ at $a=15.2$ and $4x-\\sqrt{1+6x+9x^2}$ at $x=3.18$. Choose the complete calculation pair.",
